{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create new official cards</strong> to improve your deck, and show you're the smartest Creandor in the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10.400+ existing cards</strong> made so far by fellow Creandors, that you can use to build your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>27+ BILLIONS of yet-to-be-created cards:</strong>\u00a0the best ones haven't been imagined yet. Will you do it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock a card once, use it everywhere:</strong> no need to unlock multiple copies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modding and custom game modes:</strong> Infinite replayability, your imagination is the only limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploit the sinergies</strong> of your <strong>God</strong>'s <strong>Faction</strong>, and deal the fatal blow!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring your opponent's life points to 0</strong>, or make them run out of cards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your Mana, Minions </strong>and <strong>Spells, </strong>and complete mini-quests to summon powerful <strong>Legends</strong> that can turn the tides of the match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try cards you don't own against the bots before committing to them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive scene with <strong>monthly tournaments and money prizes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/3e4dd6d341794ebb28192eaed243e7be.poster.avif?t=1774260333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/3e4dd6d341794ebb28192eaed243e7be.webm?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/3e4dd6d341794ebb28192eaed243e7be.mp4?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your cards. Invent combos. Break the Meta</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about facing the same decks over and over: in Ariokan\u2122, you have the power to <strong>create YOUR cards</strong> from scratch, <strong>give life to your original characters</strong>, and <strong>break the Meta</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you prefer to explore existing strategies, there are 8000+ existing cards waiting for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash your creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the <strong>in-game Cards Editor</strong>, you can combine the effects and keywords of 8 different Factions to create balanced cards that make your deck, and strategy, truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than 27 billions combinations at your disposal, you'll never run out of options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/9fb2ca9a15dc901d174f25bf04172c51.poster.avif?t=1774260333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/9fb2ca9a15dc901d174f25bf04172c51.webm?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/9fb2ca9a15dc901d174f25bf04172c51.mp4?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No floodgates, no 10-minutes solitaire turns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards are auto-balanced</strong> (i.e. no &quot;I win&quot; card), and <strong>immediately available</strong>\u00a0worldwide to all players that want to unlock them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also every turn is interactive, and you can play cards as a response to each of your opponent's actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/c977778bb58dd658d259b69a990a75a9.poster.avif?t=1774260333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/c977778bb58dd658d259b69a990a75a9.webm?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/c977778bb58dd658d259b69a990a75a9.mp4?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/193fed0136197ed85859e5515805652b.poster.avif?t=1774260333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/193fed0136197ed85859e5515805652b.webm?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/193fed0136197ed85859e5515805652b.mp4?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with your fantasies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every card you make, you shape Ariokan\u2122 and its universe:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add artworks and lore so each card tells your story, adding a <strong>personal touch to your deck</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're more than a player: you're part of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And with every new card, new strategies arise, making Ariokan\u2122 a game with fresh, new content every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/d784819f8292c3c024bdef6b139c63f5.poster.avif?t=1774260333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/d784819f8292c3c024bdef6b139c63f5.webm?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/d784819f8292c3c024bdef6b139c63f5.mp4?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modding: make your own game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can tweak the game rules when you play with your friends, and discover new ways to have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invent game modes, share them with other players, and play together: the only limit is your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become the God of games?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/23b2079e8a1fc8df01f6813097caf77b.avif?t=1774260333\" width=700 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn't matter if you are a seasoned card game player or if Ariokan\u2122 will be your first, you're welcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's what awaits you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>27+ BILLION combinations:</strong>\u00a0infinite replayability, your imagination is the only limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A way bring your characters into a videogame. Everything is canon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No floodgates, no 10-minutes turns: you get to play and have fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No &quot;pay to win&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant community with monthly tournaments and competitive seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock a card once, use it everywhere:</strong> no need to unlock multiple copies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of hours of gameplay in PvP, PvE and sandbox modes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2122 &amp;\u00a0\u00a9 2026\u00a0Fatum Games SL. All rights reserved.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/996bf6c94e67b16910f28e454db5f28b.avif?t=1774260333\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras_big/996bf6c94e67b16910f28e454db5f28b.webp?t=1774260333 width=1560 height=1560 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/95a5719ef6a66210e77fea44ed417ce8.avif?t=1774260333\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras_big/95a5719ef6a66210e77fea44ed417ce8.webp?t=1774260333 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3833620?t=1774260333","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3833620?t=1774260333","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/f4e8e6a1c82ab5dc8ef8b9c1318fb84b8013463e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774260333","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/f4e8e6a1c82ab5dc8ef8b9c1318fb84b8013463e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774260333","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The NSFW level is similar to League Of Legends': the characters' clothing may be considered revealing in some cultures There's no \"hardcore porn\" content. \r\n\r\nSpeaking of violence: it's a fantasy card game, and some characters talk about blood and war."},"demos":[{"appid":4050200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create new official cards</strong> to improve your deck, and show you're the smartest Creandor in the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10.400+ existing cards</strong> made so far by fellow Creandors, that you can use to build your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>27+ BILLIONS of yet-to-be-created cards:</strong>\u00a0the best ones haven't been imagined yet. Will you do it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock a card once, use it everywhere:</strong> no need to unlock multiple copies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modding and custom game modes:</strong> Infinite replayability, your imagination is the only limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploit the sinergies</strong> of your <strong>God</strong>'s <strong>Faction</strong>, and deal the fatal blow!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring your opponent's life points to 0</strong>, or make them run out of cards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your Mana, Minions </strong>and <strong>Spells, </strong>and complete mini-quests to summon powerful <strong>Legends</strong> that can turn the tides of the match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try cards you don't own against the bots before committing to them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive scene with <strong>monthly tournaments and money prizes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/3e4dd6d341794ebb28192eaed243e7be.poster.avif?t=1774260333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/3e4dd6d341794ebb28192eaed243e7be.webm?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/3e4dd6d341794ebb28192eaed243e7be.mp4?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your cards. Invent combos. Break the Meta</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about facing the same decks over and over: in Ariokan\u2122, you have the power to <strong>create YOUR cards</strong> from scratch, <strong>give life to your original characters</strong>, and <strong>break the Meta</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you prefer to explore existing strategies, there are 8000+ existing cards waiting for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash your creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the <strong>in-game Cards Editor</strong>, you can combine the effects and keywords of 8 different Factions to create balanced cards that make your deck, and strategy, truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than 27 billions combinations at your disposal, you'll never run out of options!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/9fb2ca9a15dc901d174f25bf04172c51.poster.avif?t=1774260333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/9fb2ca9a15dc901d174f25bf04172c51.webm?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/9fb2ca9a15dc901d174f25bf04172c51.mp4?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No floodgates, no 10-minutes solitaire turns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards are auto-balanced</strong> (i.e. no &quot;I win&quot; card), and <strong>immediately available</strong>\u00a0worldwide to all players that want to unlock them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also every turn is interactive, and you can play cards as a response to each of your opponent's actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/c977778bb58dd658d259b69a990a75a9.poster.avif?t=1774260333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/c977778bb58dd658d259b69a990a75a9.webm?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/c977778bb58dd658d259b69a990a75a9.mp4?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/193fed0136197ed85859e5515805652b.poster.avif?t=1774260333\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833620/extras/193fed0136197ed85859e5515805652b.webm?t=1774260333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sou